<div>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-orb"></div>
    <div class="hero-badge"><span class="pulse-dot"></span><span style="position:relative;z-index:1;">Buyers · A cost to neutralise</span></div>
    <h1>Clean your beneficiary data <span class="accent">before it becomes your bank’s problem.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">After 15 November 2026, your bank may correct its own records but is forbidden by <b>EPC §3.2</b> from touching <b>your</b> counterparty addresses — so when the network rejects a payment for an unstructured beneficiary address, the liability is yours as originator. ioNova ARS fixes every address at source, inside your ERP, TMS and pain files, <b>~98% automatically and 100% accurately</b>, before the file ever leaves your systems.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Get a sandbox <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" /><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" /></svg></a>
      <a href="#implementation" class="btn btn-outline">See the implementation plan</a>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-bar">
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad">~98%</div><div class="kpi-label">resolved automatically</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad-b">0%</div><div class="kpi-label">NAK at cutover</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad-t"><$5</div><div class="kpi-label">per exception (from $15–40)</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-tile"><div class="kpi-value grad">3–4 wks</div><div class="kpi-label">to go live</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="quote-card">
      <div class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
      <div class="quote-text">After 15 November 2026, any cross-border or SEPA payment we send with an unstructured beneficiary address is rejected at the network, and the liability is ours. Our bank can fix our address, not our counterparties’. We need every address fit to transmit, at payment speed, without our team learning the regulation.</div>
      <div class="quote-author">The problem, in their words</div>
      <div class="quote-role">Group Treasurer / Head of Payments</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section reveal">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-label">Capabilities</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What You Can Do</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="g2">
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-teal"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Readiness scan</div>
        <div class="card-body">Read-only inventory of every stored address — see exactly what fails after cutover before spending a cent.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Classify</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-blue"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m13 11 6-6"/><path d="M11 13 5 19l-2-2 6-6"/><path d="M19 5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0l-2 2 4 4 2-2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 0-4Z"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Scrub master data</div>
        <div class="card-body">One-time clean-up of the supplier/payee backlog, up to 10,000 addresses per call.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Correct · batch</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-cyan"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Validate & auto-correct a pain file</div>
        <div class="card-body">Submit a pain.001 / pain.008, receive the corrected message back, ready to transmit — not a list of errors.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Process</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent">
        <div class="icon-box ib-navy"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9"/><path d="M21 3v6h-6"/></svg></div>
        <div class="card-title">Process a pain message end-to-end</div>
        <div class="card-body">One call classifies, validates, fixes, verifies against postal data, then re-validates.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;"><span class="badge badge-accent">Process</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
